sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor T as Technician (service centre)
    participant S as Off-chain evidence store
    participant R as PassportRegistry (local chain)
    actor Sh as Shop
    actor B as Buyer
    Sh->>R: registerPassport(randomId)
    R-->>Sh: PassportRegistered
    T->>S: upload signed inspection report
    S-->>T: keccak256(report)
    T->>R: addRecord(id, Inspection, hash)
    R-->>T: RecordAdded #1
    Sh->>R: addRecord(id, Warranty, hash)
    B->>S: open passport (QR), download report
    B->>R: verifyRecord(record 1, hash of file)
    R-->>B: exists / matches / isCurrent
    T->>R: supersedeRecord(record 1, newHash)
    R-->>B: record 1 not current, see record 4
